  "question": "计算 $\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sqrt{\\cos x} - \\sqrt[3]{\\cos x}}{\\sin^2x}.$",
  "answer": "$-\\dfrac{1}{12}$",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "极限计算"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 这是 $\\frac{0}{0}$ 型极限. 应将分子有理化, 进而约去分母中的零因子再求极限. 由于分子的有理化因式较复杂, 所以作变量代换更为简便."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "令 $\\sqrt[6]{\\cos x} = u$ ，则 $\\sin^2 x = 1 - u^{12}$ ，"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "\\begin{array}{r l} \\text {原式} & = \\lim _ {u \\to 1} \\frac {u ^ {3} - u ^ {2}}{1 - u ^ {1 2}} = - \\lim _ {u \\to 1} \\frac {(u - 1) u ^ {2}}{u ^ {1 2} - 1} = - \\lim _ {u \\to 1} \\frac {(u - 1) u ^ {2}}{(u - 1) (u ^ {1 1} + u ^ {1 0} + \\cdots + u + 1)} \\\\ & = - \\lim _ {u \\to 1} \\frac {u ^ {2}}{u ^ {1 1} + u ^ {1 0} + \\cdots + u + 1} = - \\frac {1}{1 2} \\end{array}"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$-\\dfrac{1}{12}$",
    "techniques_used": [
      "极限计算"
    ]
  },
  "cdps": [
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "prompt": "该极限属于何种未定式，优先用哪类通法（等价/泰勒/夹逼/积分化）？",
